{"source":"Aquino 等 - 2023 - Myocardial Characterization with Extracellular Volume Mapping with a First-Generation Photon-countin.pdf","page":1,"pageWidth":594,"pageHeight":783,"items":[{"text":"ORIGINAL RESEARCH","rect":[434.3094,765.5081,505.10339999999974,774.5081],"fontSize":9},{"text":"•","rect":[506.7775,766.0081,513.7774999999999,773.0081],"fontSize":7},{"text":"CARDIAC IMAGING","rect":[515.4532,765.5081,579.9562000000003,774.5081],"fontSize":9},{"text":"L","rect":[72,177.2501,80.2881351,202.442],"fontSize":25.1919},{"text":"ate gadolinium enhancement (LGE) MRI is the","rect":[80.5399,189.2501,259.9198999999998,199.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"current","rect":[262.4599,189.2501,290.99990000000014,199.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"reference standard for noninvasive myocardial tissue","rect":[81.88990000000004,177.2501,291.00990000000013,187.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"characterization; however, T1 mapping and extracel-","rect":[71.99990000000004,165.2501,291.0089,175.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"lular volume (ECV) assessment are also being consid-","rect":[71.99990000000004,153.2501,291.01990000000006,163.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ered for incorporation into clinical protocols (1). The","rect":[71.99990000000004,141.2501,290.99989999999997,151.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"presence and distribution of LGE, as well as ECV, have","rect":[71.99990000000004,129.2501,291.02889999999996,139.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"been associated with various adverse outcomes in isch-","rect":[71.99990000000004,117.2501,290.99090000000007,127.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"emic and nonischemic cardiomyopathies (2–4). In par-","rect":[71.99990000000004,105.2501,291.0089000000001,115.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ticular, the addition of ECV quantification to LGE and","rect":[71.99990000000004,93.2501,291.02989999999994,103.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ejection fraction assessment has been shown to improve","rect":[71.99990000000004,81.2501,290.97990000000004,91.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"risk stratification and prediction of adverse outcomes in","rect":[71.99990000000004,69.2501,290.99989999999997,79.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"patients with heart failure (1,5–7). Although, MRI T1","rect":[71.99990000000004,57.2501,291.0268999999999,67.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"mapping has been the preferred method for ECV quan-","rect":[71.99990000000004,45.2501,290.97990000000004,55.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tification, ECV assessment with use of cardiac CT was","rect":[71.99990000000004,33.2501,291.0098999999999,43.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"implemented over the last decade with a strong correla-","rect":[308.9999,189.2501,528.0199000000011,199.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tion to MRI and histologic evaluation (8–11).","rect":[308.9999,177.2501,491.18990000000093,187.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Initially,","rect":[320.9999,165.2501,351.82989999999984,175.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"an","rect":[359.35989999999987,165.2501,368.54989999999987,175.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"energy-integrating","rect":[376.07989999999984,165.2501,444.9298999999994,175.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"detector-based","rect":[452.45989999999927,165.2501,507.009899999999,175.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"CT","rect":[514.5398999999989,165.2501,527.9998999999989,175.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"single-energy method was introduced, with the need","rect":[308.9999,153.2501,527.9998999999992,163.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"for the acquisition of unenhanced images followed by a","rect":[308.9999,141.2501,527.9998999999991,151.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"late-enhancement scan (8–10). Later, the dual-energy","rect":[308.9999,129.2501,528.0198999999991,139.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"technology allowed the creation of iodine-based CT maps","rect":[308.9999,117.2501,527.9798999999994,127.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"with accurate ECV quantification (11–15). However, its","rect":[308.9999,105.2501,527.9798999999991,115.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"incorporation into guidelines and clinical routine has been","rect":[308.9999,93.2501,528.0018999999991,103.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"limited, potentially due to the reduced temporal resolution","rect":[308.9999,81.2501,528.0018999999992,91.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"and added radiation associated with dual-energy acquisi-","rect":[308.9999,69.2501,527.9898999999991,79.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tions on the energy-integrating detector CT platform (16).","rect":[308.9999,57.2501,527.9798999999992,67.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Compared","rect":[320.9999,45.2501,362.06890000000004,55.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"with","rect":[370.0189,45.2501,387.40889999999996,55.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"energy-integrating","rect":[395.35889999999995,45.2501,465.90889999999996,55.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"detector","rect":[473.8588999999998,45.2501,505.18889999999976,55.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"CT,","rect":[513.1388999999997,45.2501,527.9988999999996,55.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"photon-counting detector (PCD) CT maintains optimal","rect":[308.9999,33.2501,528.0149000000001,43.2501],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Background:","rect":[84,480.9,115.512,488.9],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Photon-counting detector (PCD) CT provides comprehensive spectral data with every acquisition, but studies","rect":[124.0114,480.9,484.8865500000001,489.4],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"evaluating myocardial extracellular volume (ECV) quantification with use of PCD CT compared with an MRI reference remain","rect":[84.0019,471.397,503.2559000000001,479.897],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"lacking.","rect":[84.0019,461.894,109.59540000000001,470.394],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"Purpose:","rect":[84,439.8,106.29599999999999,447.8],"fontSize":8},{"text":"To compare ECV quantification for myocardial tissue characterization between a first-generation PCD CT system and","rect":[114.41290000000001,439.8,502.08770000000004,448.3],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"cardiac MRI.","rect":[83.99990000000001,430.297,127.23940000000002,438.797],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"Materials and Methods:","rect":[84,408.2,144.7672,416.2],"fontSize":8},{"text":"In this single-center prospective study, adults without contraindication to iodine-based contrast media","rect":[153.2666,408.2,487.29110000000014,416.7],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"underwent same-day cardiac PCD CT and MRI with native and postcontrast T1 mapping and late gadolinium","rect":[84.00010000000002,398.697,448.4783999999999,407.197],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"enhancement","rect":[450.5966,398.697,494.5926,407.197],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"for various clinical indications for cardiac MRI (the reference standard) between July 2021 and January 2022. Global and","rect":[84.00010000000003,389.194,481.4507500000002,397.694],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"midventricular ECV were assessed with use of three methods: single-energy PCD CT, dual-energy PCD CT, and MRI T1","rect":[84.00010000000003,379.69100000000003,483.15075000000013,388.19100000000003],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"mapping. Quantitative comparisons among all techniques were performed. Correlation and reliability between different methods of","rect":[84.00010000000003,370.18800000000005,515.0325500000001,378.68800000000005],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"ECV quantification were assessed with use of the Pearson correlation coefficient (","rect":[84.00010000000003,360.68500000000006,349.5231000000001,369.18500000000006],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"r","rect":[349.5231,360.68500000000006,352.4216,369.18500000000006],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":") and the intraclass correlation coefficient.","rect":[352.4216,360.68500000000006,489.41610000000014,369.18500000000006],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"Results:","rect":[84,338.6,104.016,346.6],"fontSize":8},{"text":"The final sample included 29 study participants (mean age ± SD, 54 years ± 17; 15 men). There was a strong correlation of","rect":[112.5157,338.6,514.03785,347.1],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"ECV between dual- and single-energy PCD CT (","rect":[83.9982,329.09700000000004,245.99120000000005,337.59700000000004],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"r","rect":[245.99120000000008,329.09700000000004,248.8897000000001,337.59700000000004],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"= 0.91,","rect":[251.0147000000001,329.09700000000004,274.38970000000006,337.59700000000004],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"P","rect":[276.51470000000006,329.09700000000004,281.20670000000007,337.59700000000004],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"< .001). Radiation dose was 40% lower with dual-energy versus single-","rect":[283.33170000000007,329.09700000000004,514.9728500000002,337.59700000000004],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"energy PCD CT (volume CT dose index, 10.1 mGy vs 16.8 mGy, respectively;","rect":[83.9982,319.59400000000005,343.51935000000003,328.09400000000005],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"P","rect":[345.64435000000014,319.59400000000005,350.33635000000015,328.09400000000005],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"< .001). In comparison with MRI, dual-energy","rect":[352.46135000000015,319.59400000000005,506.2017000000002,328.09400000000005],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"PCD CT showed strong correlation (","rect":[83.9982,310.09100000000007,206.37270000000007,318.59100000000007],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"r","rect":[206.3727000000001,310.09100000000007,209.2712000000001,318.59100000000007],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"= 0.82 and 0.91, both","rect":[211.3962000000001,310.09100000000007,283.61220000000014,318.59100000000007],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"P","rect":[285.7372000000001,310.09100000000007,290.4292000000001,318.59100000000007],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"< .001) and good to excellent reliability (intraclass correlation","rect":[292.5542000000001,310.09100000000007,493.98805000000016,318.59100000000007],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"coefficients, 0.81 and 0.90) for midventricular and global ECV quantification, but it overestimated ECV by approximately 2%.","rect":[83.9982,300.5880000000001,501.5267000000001,309.0880000000001],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"Single-energy PCD CT showed similar relationship with MRI but underestimated ECV by 3%.","rect":[83.9982,291.0850000000001,398.4217000000001,299.5850000000001],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"Conclusion:","rect":[84.0001,268.9999,112.5761,276.9999],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Myocardial tissue characterization with photon-counting detector CT–based quantitative extracellular volume analysis","rect":[121.0753,268.9999,508.28345000000024,277.4999],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"showed a strong correlation to MRI.","rect":[83.9983,259.49690000000004,203.32045,267.99690000000004],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"© RSNA, 2023","rect":[84.0001,242.75,125.79010000000008,249.75],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Supplemental material is available for this article.","rect":[84.0001,225.999,208.6351000000003,232.999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Myocardial Characterization with Extracellular Volume","rect":[72,722.7403,497.5580000000007,742.7403],"fontSize":20},{"text":"Mapping with a First-Generation Photon-counting Detector","rect":[72,700.7403,527.1400000000007,720.7403],"fontSize":20},{"text":"CT with MRI Reference","rect":[72,678.7403,247.38000000000008,698.7403],"fontSize":20},{"text":"Gilberto J. Aquino, MD","rect":[72,648.7403,158.92000000000002,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[163.32,648.7403,167.32,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Jim O’Doherty, PhD","rect":[171.72,648.7403,246.54999999999987,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[250.95,648.7403,254.95,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"U. Joseph Schoepf, MD","rect":[259.34999999999997,648.7403,342.4299999999997,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[346.8299999999999,648.7403,350.8299999999999,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Benjamin Ellison, MS","rect":[355.2299999999999,648.7403,435.3599999999997,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[439.7599999999999,648.7403,443.7599999999999,658.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Jordan Byrne, MS","rect":[72.00999999999982,637.7403,137.46999999999986,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[141.8699999999998,637.7403,145.8699999999998,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Nicola Fink, MD","rect":[150.26999999999978,637.7403,213.2409999999997,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[217.6409999999997,637.7403,221.6409999999997,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Emese Zsarnoczay, MD","rect":[226.04099999999968,637.7403,311.2499999999995,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[315.6499999999995,637.7403,319.6499999999995,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Elias V. Wolf","rect":[324.0499999999995,637.7403,369.2899999999994,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[373.6899999999995,637.7403,377.6899999999995,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Thomas Allmendinger, PhD","rect":[382.08999999999946,637.7403,482.4499999999992,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[486.8499999999992,637.7403,490.8499999999992,647.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Bernhard Schmidt, PhD","rect":[72.00999999999982,626.7403,160.74999999999977,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[165.1499999999998,626.7403,169.1499999999998,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Thomas Flohr, PhD","rect":[173.5499999999998,626.7403,244.6999999999997,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[249.0999999999998,626.7403,253.0999999999998,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Dhiraj Baruah, MD","rect":[257.4999999999998,626.7403,332.43999999999954,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[336.8399999999998,626.7403,340.8399999999998,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Pal Suranyi, MD, PhD","rect":[345.2399999999998,626.7403,429.73999999999955,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[434.13999999999976,626.7403,438.13999999999976,636.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Akos Varga-Szemes, MD, PhD","rect":[72.01999999999975,615.7403,182.1379999999997,625.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[186.53999999999974,615.7403,190.53999999999974,625.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Tilman Emrich, MD","rect":[194.57999999999973,615.7403,270.9809999999996,625.7403],"fontSize":10},{"text":"From the Division of Cardiovascular Imaging, Department of Radiology and Radiological Science, Heart & Vascular Center, Medical University of South Carolina,","rect":[72,599.7403,528.0401999999999,606.7403],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Ashley River Tower, 25 Courtenay Dr, Charleston, SC 29425-2260 (G.J.A., U.J.S., B.E., J.B., N.F., E.Z., E.V.W., D.B., P.S., A.V.S., T.E.); Department of Radiology,","rect":[72,591.2423,527.9877000000002,598.2423],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Upstate","rect":[72,582.7443,92.72,589.7443],"fontSize":7},{"text":"University Hospital, Syracuse, NY (G.J.A.); Siemens Medical Solutions, Malvern, Pa (J.O.); Department of Radiology, University Hospital LMU Munich,","rect":[95.394,582.7443,528.0017,589.7443],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Munich,","rect":[72,574.2462999999999,95.345,581.2462999999999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Germany (N.F.); Siemens Healthineers, Forchheim, Germany (T.A., B.S., T.F.); Department of Radiology, University Medical Center of the Johannes Gutenberg","rect":[96.913,574.2462999999999,528.0408999999999,581.2462999999999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"U","rect":[72,565.7482999999999,77.222,572.7482999999999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"niversity Mainz, Mainz, Germany (T.E.); and German Center for Cardiovascular Research (DZHK), Partner Site Rhine Main, Mainz, Germany (T.E.). Received August","rect":[76.97,565.7482999999999,527.9639000000004,572.7482999999999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"10, 2022; revision requested September 16; revision received December 1; accepted December 5.","rect":[72,557.2502999999998,333.69220000000007,564.2502999999998],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Address correspondence to","rect":[335.4421999999999,557.2502999999998,411.6155,564.2502999999998],"fontSize":7},{"text":"U.J.S. (email:","rect":[413.36549999999994,557.2502999999998,450.05249999999995,564.2502999999998],"fontSize":7},{"text":"schoepf@musc.edu","rect":[451.8024999999999,557.2502999999998,498.6814999999999,564.2502999999998],"fontSize":7},{"text":").","rect":[498.68149999999986,557.2502999999998,502.67149999999987,564.2502999999998],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Supported by Siemens Healthineers. D.B. supported by BlueDoc AI grant.","rect":[72,544.7482999999999,273.8709,551.7482999999999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Conflicts of interest are listed at the end of this article.","rect":[72,532.2462999999999,218.46590000000006,539.2462999999999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Radiology 2023; 307(2):e222030","rect":[72,517.1262999999999,164.5673,524.1262999999999],"fontSize":7},{"text":"•","rect":[168.0665,515.9203,172.4445,526.9203],"fontSize":11},{"text":"https://doi.org/10.1148/radiol.222030","rect":[175.9444,517.1203,283.9684,524.1203],"fontSize":7},{"text":"•","rect":[287.4664,515.9203,291.8444,526.9203],"fontSize":11},{"text":"Content codes:","rect":[295.3443,517.1203,337.08529999999996,524.1203],"fontSize":7},{"text":"This copy is for personal use only. To order printed copies, contact","rect":[97.5883,6.7442,409.02070000000003,18.7442],"fontSize":12},{"text":"reprints@rsna.org","rect":[411.81669999999997,6.7442,496.41549999999995,18.7442],"fontSize":12}]}